            <ArticleTitle>Factor structure of the Health Concerns Questionnaire in elderly chronic pain patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>652-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The factor structure and psychometric properties of the Health Concerns Questionnaire were evaluated in a sample of 133 elderly chronic pain outpatients. Reliability and validity data are presented for the HCQ total scores, 3 varimax rotated factors, and 3 content scales that distinguish endorsement of medically versus psychologically oriented items.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
